sequenceDiagram
    participant App as "Application<br/>startup"
    participant Spring as "Spring Boot<br/>Environment"
    participant Props as "classpath:aws/aws.yml<br/>(loaded by YmlConfig)"
    participant Model as "erp-infrastructure<br/>AwsConfigModel(record)"
    participant Config as "erp-infrastructure<br/>S3BucketConfig"
    participant AWS as "AWS S3 Client<br/>S3Client(bean)"

    App->>Spring: start
    Spring->>Props: load aws/aws.yml
    Spring->>Model: bind properties -> AwsConfigModel
    Spring->>Config: instantiate S3BucketConfig bean
    Config->>Model: inject AwsConfigModel
    Config->>AWS: build S3Client(endpoint,region,credentials)
    Note right of AWS: S3Client bean available to adapters
